1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:36,652 --> 00:01:38,000
The Thunder Bagua...

20
00:01:39,174 --> 00:01:41,391
I thought I defended against it...

21
00:01:42,608 --> 00:01:44,782
Yet, it was
nowhere near enough...

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Yamabro!

23
00:01:47,869 --> 00:01:50,217
Go help "Gutless" out!

24
00:01:52,435 --> 00:01:55,261
Wh-Who are you calling "Gutless"?!

25
00:01:55,652 --> 00:01:58,609
Go do the damn thing
already, Momo!

26
00:02:00,043 --> 00:02:03,695
S-Silence!
I am fully aware of what I must do!

27
00:02:04,217 --> 00:02:08,043
Do you truly believe people
can change so easily?!

28
00:02:11,913 --> 00:02:14,565
Fear not, Momonosuke-kun!

29
00:02:15,086 --> 00:02:16,999
I am coming with you!

30
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:22,043
Apologies for leaving you earlier!

31
00:02:22,043 --> 00:02:23,303
Yamato!

32
00:02:23,304 --> 00:02:26,651
Well, then!
Let us stop Onigashima!

33
00:02:27,739 --> 00:02:29,913
Countin' on ya, Momo!

34
00:02:33,957 --> 00:02:36,043
Hey, Yamato!

35
00:02:36,043 --> 00:02:37,303
Momonosuke!

36
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:44,043
Where the hell do you
think you're going?!

37
00:02:53,957 --> 00:02:55,696
Lend me your strength...

38
00:02:57,696 --> 00:02:59,000
Kin'emon!

39
00:03:00,565 --> 00:03:01,608
Kiku!

40
00:03:03,174 --> 00:03:05,826
I will surely...!

41
00:03:11,739 --> 00:03:13,913
Make haste, Momonosuke-kun!

42
00:03:44,304 --> 00:03:45,434
Yamabro!

43
00:03:45,957 --> 00:03:47,087
I understand!

44
00:03:47,957 --> 00:03:49,696
You want to face him
in a duel, aye?

45
00:03:52,043 --> 00:03:53,608
Yup!

46
00:04:04,913 --> 00:04:07,348
I am going to diiiie!

47
00:04:11,869 --> 00:04:13,956
Mo...
Momonosuke-kun!

48
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,260
Clutch the sky!

49
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:17,782
Clutch?!

50
00:04:18,696 --> 00:04:22,782
Dragons can create clouds!

51
00:04:22,782 --> 00:04:24,739
C-Create?!

52
00:04:24,739 --> 00:04:27,261
You are a dragon now!

53
00:04:34,521 --> 00:04:36,608
You can do it!

54
00:04:38,435 --> 00:04:41,130
I am... a dragon.

55
00:04:42,435 --> 00:04:43,608
I create...

56
00:04:44,652 --> 00:04:46,130
...clouds!

57
00:04:51,130 --> 00:04:52,130
I know...

58
00:04:52,652 --> 00:04:53,913
I know how!

59
00:04:54,347 --> 00:04:55,695
That's it!

60
00:05:01,217 --> 00:05:02,391
Kin'emon!

61
00:05:03,608 --> 00:05:06,782
Take Momonosuke-sama and flee!

62
00:05:08,174 --> 00:05:09,695
I will...

63
00:05:12,696 --> 00:05:16,304
...Surely come back to you,
my retainers!

64
00:05:17,869 --> 00:05:20,304
Dragons do not merely fly!

65
00:05:20,304 --> 00:05:23,521
They create clouds, clutch them,

66
00:05:25,086 --> 00:05:27,129
and dash through the skies!

67
00:05:27,478 --> 00:05:29,521
Such are dragons!

68
00:05:34,565 --> 00:05:38,478
I am flyilling!

69
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:41,304
These clouds are called...

70
00:05:46,043 --> 00:05:47,564
...Flame Clouds!

71
00:05:52,086 --> 00:05:54,477
Momonosuke-kun!
Look!

72
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:01,782
This is most unusual!

73
00:06:01,782 --> 00:06:04,173
The island is starting to collapse!

74
00:06:04,174 --> 00:06:05,652
What?!

75
00:06:05,652 --> 00:06:07,869
Is that a... problem?

76
00:06:09,565 --> 00:06:10,695
It cannot be...

77
00:06:11,217 --> 00:06:13,608
Kaido is...

78
00:06:13,608 --> 00:06:15,304
...losing strength!

79
00:06:15,913 --> 00:06:18,565
The Flame Clouds Kaido created
are becoming unstable,

80
00:06:18,913 --> 00:06:22,304
and they can no longer support
the fracturing bedrock!

81
00:06:22,347 --> 00:06:24,217
We must hurry then!

82
00:06:24,217 --> 00:06:27,739
I care not what hapens to me!

83
00:06:32,435 --> 00:06:38,174
I shall not permit such a treacherous thing
to make its way to the Flower Capital!

84
00:06:39,304 --> 00:06:42,130
You mustn't,
Momonosuke-kun!

85
00:06:45,521 --> 00:06:49,478
I grew so that I could
stop this island!

86
00:06:50,130 --> 00:06:52,434
You cannot,
Momonosuke-kun!

87
00:06:52,869 --> 00:06:54,956
This is not the way!

88
00:06:55,739 --> 00:06:57,826
But we do not have time!

89
00:06:57,826 --> 00:07:00,999
And lo!
We are very nearly at the capital!

90
00:07:01,391 --> 00:07:04,174
It will arrive
in less than five minutes!

91
00:07:04,174 --> 00:07:06,434
Out with the
Flame Clouds, then!

92
00:07:06,869 --> 00:07:09,608
With those colossal,
draconic clouds,

93
00:07:09,608 --> 00:07:12,738
Kaido is moving Onigashima!

94
00:07:12,739 --> 00:07:17,521
To push it back, you must create
more powerful Flame Clouds than his!

95
00:07:17,521 --> 00:07:20,999
That is impossible!
cannot possibly produce such things!

96
00:07:21,478 --> 00:07:23,869
I have barely learned flight!

97
00:07:23,869 --> 00:07:28,260
Besides, I do not necessarily share
the same powers as he!

98
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:32,043
But you can conjure Flame Clouds!
I am sure you are capable!

99
00:07:35,130 --> 00:07:37,391
It is all in our hands now.

100
00:07:37,913 --> 00:07:40,783
The situation is more dire
than we thought!

101
00:07:41,347 --> 00:07:44,825
Even if it lands as Kaido plans,

102
00:07:45,521 --> 00:07:47,956
there will be numerous
casualties in the capital!

103
00:07:48,347 --> 00:07:52,912
In the worst-case scenario...
Should Kaido runs out of strength,

104
00:07:53,478 --> 00:07:57,565
the Flame Clouds will disappear,
sending Onigashima hurtling to the ground!

105
00:07:58,043 --> 00:08:02,651
Stored within Onigashima are
unfathomable quantities of weapons...

106
00:08:02,652 --> 00:08:04,304
...and gunpowder!

107
00:08:07,608 --> 00:08:11,347
Onigashima is practically
a titanic bomb!

108
00:08:11,347 --> 00:08:13,564
And it is much too close...

109
00:08:13,608 --> 00:08:16,565
There is not enough time for
the citizenry to evacuate!

110
00:08:16,565 --> 00:08:19,130
Should the island come down,

111
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:21,347
enemy and ally alike
will meet a grisly fate!

112
00:08:21,913 --> 00:08:24,826
Eh?!
Then we must stop Luffy!

113
00:08:26,739 --> 00:08:28,826
Fool!

114
00:08:29,478 --> 00:08:34,000
He already totters on the precipice,
bearing the world upon his shoulders!

115
00:08:34,696 --> 00:08:38,565
'Tis only he who can fell Kaido!

116
00:08:41,043 --> 00:08:43,825
We mustn't burden him further
with this development!

117
00:08:44,391 --> 00:08:48,304
We shall weather this storm,
and with none the wiser!

118
00:09:07,739 --> 00:09:10,869
Hit the deck!
King-sama's totally flipped!

119
00:09:33,043 --> 00:09:34,521
Zoro!

120
00:09:34,957 --> 00:09:37,130
What happened to you?!

121
00:09:39,391 --> 00:09:41,608
King the Wildfire...

122
00:09:41,608 --> 00:09:45,434
He ain't an All-Star for nothin'.

123
00:09:45,435 --> 00:09:47,304
He's damn strong...

124
00:09:47,652 --> 00:09:49,521
No surprise there.

125
00:09:49,521 --> 00:09:51,738
The hell's goin' on,
over on the Floor?

126
00:09:51,826 --> 00:09:52,869
Need a hand?

127
00:09:52,869 --> 00:09:55,739
Nah, I'm good!

128
00:10:01,043 --> 00:10:03,999
Dammit, King!

129
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:07,869
Don't just throw out random attacks!
You cut my butt!

130
00:10:07,869 --> 00:10:10,652
Better if it were your neck!

131
00:10:13,217 --> 00:10:18,608
Pirate Hunter Zoro...
damaged King-san's mask!

132
00:10:18,608 --> 00:10:23,086
Yeah, that would piss him off...

133
00:10:23,086 --> 00:10:27,086
Nobody knows what he looks like
under that mask!

134
00:10:29,608 --> 00:10:31,782
Sorry, Franky...

135
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:33,434
Better steer clear!

136
00:10:33,435 --> 00:10:36,000
Gotcha, hang in there!

137
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:47,739
Three-Sword Style:

138
00:10:55,304 --> 00:10:56,695
Imperial...

139
00:10:59,217 --> 00:10:59,913
...Archer!

140
00:10:59,957 --> 00:11:01,217
Ultra Tiger...

141
00:11:03,608 --> 00:11:04,086
...Hunt!

142
00:11:16,739 --> 00:11:17,435
What the?!

143
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:19,260
Wait...

144
00:11:24,521 --> 00:11:25,651
I'm gonna fall!

145
00:11:27,130 --> 00:11:28,347
Two-Sword Style:

146
00:11:28,347 --> 00:11:29,869
Clear Lance!

147
00:11:45,086 --> 00:11:46,825
Close one...!

148
00:11:46,826 --> 00:11:48,912
At least use your
damn sword to kill me!

149
00:11:49,957 --> 00:11:51,087
I ain't lettin' you off!

150
00:11:52,130 --> 00:11:53,695
Same to you!

151
00:11:57,957 --> 00:12:02,174
Do you doubt me?
Think I'm lying, perhaps?

152
00:12:02,174 --> 00:12:03,826
Never said that.

153
00:12:04,174 --> 00:12:09,695
What I'm saying is, another dragon that isn't Kaido
made their appearance.

154
00:12:09,696 --> 00:12:14,217
This must be the Devil Fruit-
Vegapunk created!

155
00:12:14,826 --> 00:12:17,217
And they appear to be
allied with Straw Hat Luffy.

156
00:12:17,217 --> 00:12:21,565
That's fine, isn't it?
Just pirates trying to put each other out of business.

157
00:12:23,086 --> 00:12:25,564
Then, what did you call us for?

158
00:12:25,565 --> 00:12:28,043
Got orders from above.

159
00:12:28,043 --> 00:12:32,521
"If by any chance Kaido loses...

160
00:12:32,521 --> 00:12:35,825
"the Land of Wano,
a non-member state of the World Government,

161
00:12:35,826 --> 00:12:39,478
"is to be brought under
direct control of the Government."

162
00:12:40,391 --> 00:12:44,348
We've already
dispatched ships to Wano...

163
00:12:44,696 --> 00:12:47,565
Seizing a country by force, huh?

164
00:12:47,565 --> 00:12:51,260
No better than
pirates themselves...

165
00:12:51,696 --> 00:12:54,000
What are the odds
that Kaido loses?

166
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,435
In the beginning, Kaido had 30,000 troops,
but that shrank to 12,000...

167
00:13:06,391 --> 00:13:10,565
It is a fascinating battle,
I'll admit...

168
00:13:10,565 --> 00:13:14,565
I can't see
Kaido actually falling, however.

169
00:13:15,304 --> 00:13:16,912
I didn't think so...

170
00:13:16,913 --> 00:13:18,913
Keep me updated.

171
00:13:18,913 --> 00:13:22,435
# Oh, and...
One more order that came down:

172
00:13:27,043 --> 00:13:30,521
Bring Nico Robin in!

173
00:13:38,696 --> 00:13:42,435
Further failure
will not be tolerated.

174
00:13:42,435 --> 00:13:44,304
We know.

175
00:13:44,304 --> 00:13:45,869
Clik.

176
00:13:47,739 --> 00:13:51,174
You expect I would hand over
a friend of mine?!

177
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:57,390
Three-Verse Humming:

178
00:14:01,043 --> 00:14:03,043
Nock Slash!

179
00:14:06,217 --> 00:14:10,347
How was I?
Was I the slightest bit helpful?

180
00:14:10,347 --> 00:14:12,608
Yes, quite!

181
00:14:13,478 --> 00:14:15,000
Whoa!

182
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,565
Are you all right?

183
00:14:16,565 --> 00:14:18,695
Thank you, Brook.

184
00:14:18,696 --> 00:14:20,913
There she is!
It's Nico Robin!

185
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,435
Don't let her get away!

186
00:14:22,478 --> 00:14:24,826
Nab her!

187
00:14:24,826 --> 00:14:28,521
My, my!
They've sent the horde!

188
00:14:28,565 --> 00:14:31,391
You're quite
the popular one, Robin-san!

189
00:14:31,478 --> 00:14:33,130
It's a bother, really!

190
00:14:33,217 --> 00:14:34,652
Whatever shall I do?

191
00:14:34,739 --> 00:14:37,652
I know how hard it is,
being the center of attention.

192
00:14:37,739 --> 00:14:41,391
But don't you worry
shall defend you, come what may!

193
00:14:41,478 --> 00:14:44,043
Most reassuring, Brook!

194
00:14:46,347 --> 00:14:48,825
Careful,
or I'll get carried away!

195
00:14:50,696 --> 00:14:52,696
Stop right there!

196
00:14:58,086 --> 00:14:59,608
Come forth!

197
00:14:59,608 --> 00:15:02,086
O stronger clouds!

198
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:07,260
Tis progressing
faster than I thought...

199
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:10,913
The speed of its collapse...!

200
00:15:15,696 --> 00:15:17,652
Listen, Momonosuke-kun!

201
00:15:19,217 --> 00:15:22,086
I shall return to the Skull Dome,

202
00:15:22,086 --> 00:15:25,999
to minimize the damage that may come
from the worst possible outcome.

203
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,261
Whaaaa?!

204
00:15:27,739 --> 00:15:31,609
There are countless explosives
in the giant armory beneath the dome...

205
00:15:32,086 --> 00:15:34,260
...that I must somehow
dispose of,

206
00:15:35,086 --> 00:15:36,608
lest the worst comes to pass,

207
00:15:36,608 --> 00:15:39,738
and the damage caused is
multiplied many times over!

208
00:15:58,086 --> 00:15:59,912
I shall leave this task to you!

209
00:16:01,565 --> 00:16:04,956
Eh?!
You would leave me behind?!

210
00:16:04,957 --> 00:16:09,217
I am certain you can summon
Flame Clouds more powerful than Kaido's!

211
00:16:11,782 --> 00:16:14,608
Damn! Damn!
Damn it all!

212
00:16:16,521 --> 00:16:18,173
I summon thee, Flame Clouds!

213
00:16:23,478 --> 00:16:25,217
How could he...

214
00:16:25,782 --> 00:16:28,043
...leave me alone?!

215
00:16:28,043 --> 00:16:31,347
Nay!
No more petty grousing, Momonosuke!

216
00:16:31,347 --> 00:16:33,217
You can do this!
I know you can!

217
00:16:37,043 --> 00:16:39,303
Alas, I cannot!

218
00:16:40,608 --> 00:16:42,869
Nay, nay
I must do this!

219
00:16:43,565 --> 00:16:45,869
Create clouds, then clutch them!

220
00:16:46,739 --> 00:16:48,391
I summon thee...

221
00:16:48,391 --> 00:16:50,000
Flame Clouds!

222
00:16:54,782 --> 00:16:55,869
I summon thee!

223
00:16:56,739 --> 00:17:01,130
I must do this,
else many of my people will perish!

224
00:17:07,869 --> 00:17:10,173
I will not let this island...

225
00:17:10,478 --> 00:17:14,043
...this massive bomb, fall!

226
00:17:31,739 --> 00:17:32,782
What?!

227
00:17:32,782 --> 00:17:34,304
A huge wolf?!

228
00:17:40,086 --> 00:17:42,695
It is in your hands now,
Momonosuke-kun!

229
00:17:42,696 --> 00:17:45,435
I summon thee, Flame Clouds!

230
00:17:46,217 --> 00:17:48,130
Because it is you...

231
00:17:48,217 --> 00:17:49,695
...you will succeed!

232
00:17:56,565 --> 00:17:59,043
Vinsmoke Sanji!

233
00:17:59,043 --> 00:18:03,173
Dance with me some more!

234
00:18:03,174 --> 00:18:04,260
Flying Pan!

235
00:18:10,217 --> 00:18:12,521
I'm a super machine gun!

236
00:18:12,565 --> 00:18:15,521
Ain't nobody gonna
stop my funk!

237
00:18:19,347 --> 00:18:20,260
Heavy!

238
00:18:23,957 --> 00:18:25,957
My attacks won't stop comin'!

239
00:18:30,478 --> 00:18:33,130
C'mon, show it to me...

240
00:18:34,739 --> 00:18:38,000
Germa 66's combat suit!

241
00:18:45,739 --> 00:18:47,739
Sanji!

242
00:18:47,739 --> 00:18:51,869
You were showinoff your combat suit
to King, weren't ya?!

243
00:18:51,869 --> 00:18:54,652
I'm pretty damn sure
you went invisible right then!

244
00:18:54,739 --> 00:18:57,130
That's Judge's
scientific smarts for ya!

245
00:18:57,130 --> 00:18:59,608
Stupid ass loudmouth lizard!

246
00:19:01,696 --> 00:19:03,608
Man, I really am feeling off...

247
00:19:03,608 --> 00:19:06,956
Put on that suit, Vinsmoke!

248
00:19:06,957 --> 00:19:09,043
I told you to
drop that damn name!

249
00:19:09,043 --> 00:19:11,738
You don't know squat about
what's going on in my family!

250
00:19:11,739 --> 00:19:13,913
Scratch that,
they're not my family at all!

251
00:19:13,913 --> 00:19:16,217
I ain't wearing that crap!

252
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,652
Black...

253
00:19:24,347 --> 00:19:25,782
...Light Roast!

254
00:19:33,347 --> 00:19:35,347
Diable Jambe:

255
00:19:44,174 --> 00:19:45,782
Bien Cuit...

256
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:53,738
...Gril Shot!

257
00:20:24,652 --> 00:20:26,478
No damage?!
But that was Sanji-san's kick!

258
00:20:28,565 --> 00:20:31,347
What'm I gonna do...

259
00:20:31,347 --> 00:20:33,477
...about this dino's toughness?

260
00:20:36,086 --> 00:20:39,260
Pretty good kick,
for plain ol' flesh 'n blood.

261
00:20:39,347 --> 00:20:45,825
Well, how bout I show you
what an unmodified dino can really do...!

262
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:51,260
Show you the power of those that dominated the world
for over a hundred million years!

263
00:20:59,565 --> 00:21:02,130
Puny humans...

264
00:21:02,174 --> 00:21:04,521
On your knees!

265
00:21:12,347 --> 00:21:13,521
Here it comes!

266
00:21:13,521 --> 00:21:16,086
The true power of the ancients!

267
00:21:16,086 --> 00:21:19,564
Cry! Scream!
Cower in fear!

268
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,391
Here I go!

269
00:21:32,957 --> 00:21:35,565
Brachiosnakeus!

270
00:21:38,521 --> 00:21:42,130
Hwuuuuh?!

271
00:21:42,913 --> 00:21:45,609
Hwuw-
That's how it works!!

272
00:21:50,391 --> 00:21:51,913
Ah, crap!

273
00:22:00,391 --> 00:22:03,043
You dropped your guard!

274
00:22:03,043 --> 00:22:06,347
This's the kind of dino
a brachiosaurus is!

275
00:22:06,347 --> 00:22:09,390
You don't say...
Dammit!

276
00:22:10,217 --> 00:22:15,739
Now you see the true power of the dinosaur,
king of the ancient world!

277
00:22:21,739 --> 00:22:28,696
Nobody's ever gotten loose
from the Brachiocoilus!
LN

278
00:22:29,086 --> 00:22:30,216
Sangoro-san!

279
00:22:30,217 --> 00:22:33,478
Sanji-san's done for
if this keeps up!

280
00:22:33,478 --> 00:22:37,130
He's in real danger!
A human body can't stand that!

281
00:22:37,130 --> 00:22:38,826
Sanji!

282
00:22:42,739 --> 00:22:46,739
Who knew dinosaurs
were this terrifying...!

283
00:22:46,739 --> 00:22:48,174
Sangoro san!

284
00:22:50,521 --> 00:22:53,825
Not even a master of
Conqueror's Haki...

285
00:22:53,826 --> 00:22:58,826
...can prevent my pressure from
shattering their bones and crushing their organs!

286
00:22:58,826 --> 00:23:01,260
Anyone caught in it
ain't comin' back!

287
00:23:01,826 --> 00:23:05,608
Done so soon,
son of Judge?!

288
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:09,826
If you show me what
Germa's got cookin',

289
00:23:09,826 --> 00:23:12,739
I'll let ya go.

290
00:23:13,652 --> 00:23:14,956
I refuse...!

291
00:23:22,782 --> 00:23:27,217
Check that out!
Were I just any old brachiosaurus...

292
00:23:27,217 --> 00:23:31,347
my torso and legs
would be totally useless!

293
00:23:31,347 --> 00:23:34,390
But... I'm a scientist!

294
00:23:39,435 --> 00:23:42,260
Torso-mounted super weapons!

295
00:23:42,260 --> 00:23:47,304
A genius idea
for making use of the useless!

296
00:23:47,304 --> 00:23:52,434
All I gotta do is call out their name,
and they'll come flyinright at ya!

297
00:23:52,435 --> 00:23:54,391
They're the
Brachio Launchers!

298
00:23:57,304 --> 00:23:59,173
Queen-sama!

299
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:00,957
No!

300
00:24:01,435 --> 00:24:03,260
was just...

301
00:24:03,260 --> 00:24:04,608
...explaining...

302
00:24:04,608 --> 00:24:08,521
You damned piece o' junk!
Do it only when I shout it out like an attack...!

303
00:24:08,521 --> 00:24:11,043
Like this: Brachio Launchers...

304
00:24:12,782 --> 00:24:14,652
Queen-sama!

305
00:24:19,521 --> 00:24:23,825
M-Man...
I pack a helluva punch...

306
00:24:23,826 --> 00:24:28,478
But! My constriction technique's decided things!
This fight's over!

307
00:24:29,043 --> 00:24:32,564
You are already... dead.

308
00:24:32,565 --> 00:24:36,565
Every bone in his body's
got to be broken,

309
00:24:36,565 --> 00:24:40,521
and there's no way
his internal organs're intact...

310
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:44,435
We must administer
the super-restorative!

311
00:24:44,435 --> 00:24:45,478
Yes!

312
00:24:47,869 --> 00:24:49,434
Whaaaa?!

313
00:24:57,739 --> 00:25:00,043
Are you all right, my boy?!

314
00:25:00,043 --> 00:25:05,477
Well, it definitely hurts,
but I can move around like I usually do...

315
00:25:05,478 --> 00:25:10,478
You're scarin' me, Sanji...
Did you turn into a zombie?!

316
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,217
A zombie?

317
00:25:19,347 --> 00:25:20,608
What's...

318
00:25:21,608 --> 00:25:24,565
What's happening to my body?!

319
00:25:26,826 --> 00:25:28,347
Don't tell me...

320
00:25:28,957 --> 00:25:32,826
...I've awakened the same
enhancements as them....

321
00:25:33,782 --> 00:25:35,391
Sanji!

322
00:25:35,435 --> 00:25:38,652
Stay focused!
Behind you!

323
00:25:39,217 --> 00:25:40,565
I'm back to myself?

324
00:25:40,826 --> 00:25:43,086
Ya little runt!

325
00:25:46,696 --> 00:25:47,956
Ouch.

326
00:25:56,608 --> 00:25:57,695
What?

327
00:26:02,739 --> 00:26:03,565
I don't wanna...

328
00:26:11,521 --> 00:26:12,434
...become a monster...

329
00:26:13,435 --> 00:26:15,478
...like any of them!